WEBVTT

00:01:34.470 --> 00:01:37.890
Psychic\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hPrincess

00:01:34.470 --> 00:01:37.890
Psychic\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hPrincess

00:01:37.970 --> 00:01:40.390
<i>Episode 11</i>

00:01:43.920 --> 00:01:45.740
What do you plan to do with these?

00:01:47.180 --> 00:01:50.140
It is already raining... Redecorate maybe?

00:01:50.640 --> 00:01:52.970
Your Highness, is this enough?

00:01:53.410 --> 00:01:56.220
Can you see anything else you want us to fetch?

00:01:58.150 --> 00:01:59.330
Let me see...

00:02:00.560 --> 00:02:02.590
It seems like something's still missing.

00:02:03.540 --> 00:02:07.390
There are pebbles around the 
corner of the hallway. Fetch some.

00:02:09.390 --> 00:02:10.890
<i><i>Does he know what I'm going to do? </i></i>

00:02:12.060 --> 00:02:14.580
<i><i>So he just pretended not to know?</i></i>

00:02:15.430 --> 00:02:17.010
<i><i>This guy's despicable.</i></i>

00:02:57.890 --> 00:02:59.140
She even knows martial arts!

00:03:00.020 --> 00:03:02.770
This Princess Ye is most unpredictable.

00:03:03.100 --> 00:03:05.640
Indeed. A child full of surprises.

00:03:05.960 --> 00:03:08.640
<i><i>This woman sincerely 
wishes to help Lanshuang.</i></i>

00:03:18.140 --> 00:03:19.270
<i><i>I'll need some more here.</i></i>

00:03:29.930 --> 00:03:30.770
What are you doing?

00:04:22.560 --> 00:04:23.870
Thanks for the help.

00:04:23.870 --> 00:04:28.530
Even though your personality stinks most of 
the time, you can be kindhearted at times.

00:04:28.530 --> 00:04:29.760
P-Pardon?

00:04:30.600 --> 00:04:34.270
Now, the banquet can continue. Isn't it great?

00:04:48.680 --> 00:04:52.140
As expected from the maiden I had 
my eye on. You are very smart indeed!

00:04:53.180 --> 00:04:55.430
I did not expect Princess 
Ye to know martial arts.

00:04:55.430 --> 00:04:57.480
She is certainly not some
spoiled, pampered lady.

00:04:58.220 --> 00:04:59.140
How admirable.

00:04:59.850 --> 00:05:02.230
You were the important 
guest at Father's feast.

00:05:02.230 --> 00:05:04.140
Or should I say... the pervert!

00:05:08.190 --> 00:05:09.640
Hey! What are you doing?!

00:05:10.890 --> 00:05:12.890
Where are you taking me?! Put me down!

00:05:15.790 --> 00:05:17.890
Greetings, Your Highnesses.

00:05:20.050 --> 00:05:22.020
The prince and princess
 are so good together.

00:05:23.640 --> 00:05:26.950
People are looking at us, Prince Jerk!
 Are you crazy? Put me down!

00:05:26.950 --> 00:05:27.770
So what if they are?

00:05:28.260 --> 00:05:30.140
Put me down! I can walk by myself!

00:05:31.770 --> 00:05:34.060
Greetings, Your Highnesses.

00:05:37.020 --> 00:05:41.100
Wait! I'm not going in! I'm not going in!
What do you want to do to me?

00:05:41.600 --> 00:05:43.710
I warned you more than once already.

00:05:44.250 --> 00:05:46.200
Do not defy me.

00:05:46.200 --> 00:05:47.580
Do you not remember?

00:05:48.080 --> 00:05:51.180
So what?! Put me down, Prince Jerk!

00:05:51.180 --> 00:05:52.540
Stop wasting your energy.

00:05:53.300 --> 00:05:56.520
Damn you! I told you I don't want to go in!

00:05:58.520 --> 00:06:00.030
No!

00:06:02.060 --> 00:06:04.020
You perverted Prince Jerk!

00:06:05.000 --> 00:06:06.640
Put me down!

00:06:11.900 --> 00:06:14.890
Damn, you threw me <i>again</i>!

00:06:16.560 --> 00:06:17.570
Change your clothes.

00:06:20.720 --> 00:06:24.440
No one is allowed to see you wet except me.

00:06:26.600 --> 00:06:28.890
That man...

00:06:30.140 --> 00:06:34.500
Go in and help my princess clean and change,
 then return her to the banquet.

00:06:35.020 --> 00:06:35.890
Yes, Your Highness.

00:06:41.520 --> 00:06:45.680
This Princess Ye is most impressive. Truly.

00:06:46.240 --> 00:06:50.320
The view has suddenly become 
much more elegant. Not bad.

00:06:51.180 --> 00:06:54.140
Announcing Princess Ye!

00:07:01.140 --> 00:07:04.890
Wow, she is so beautiful, like 
a fairy princess descending to Earth!

00:07:11.960 --> 00:07:16.160
<i><i>The effect isn't bad. It's great that 
the birthday party can continue.</i></i>

00:07:23.570 --> 00:07:26.890
Greetings, Imperial Majesty. 
Long may you live.

00:07:27.640 --> 00:07:29.020
You may rise.

00:07:33.040 --> 00:07:38.930
Good timing. I shall reward you 
for aiding Princess Lanshuang.

00:07:39.430 --> 00:07:41.520
Is there anything you desire?

00:07:44.610 --> 00:07:46.790
There isn't anything I desire.

00:07:46.790 --> 00:07:50.310
I'm just happy I could help
 keep this banquet going.

00:07:51.780 --> 00:07:52.910
Well said.

00:07:53.470 --> 00:07:55.890
As I thought, you are different 
from the others, Princess Ye.

00:07:56.240 --> 00:08:00.930
In that case, when you have decided 
what you want as a reward, simply ask.

00:08:02.140 --> 00:08:03.310
Many thanks, Imperial Majesty.

00:08:04.270 --> 00:08:05.520
Have a seat.

00:08:05.900 --> 00:08:07.180
May the banquet continue!

00:08:23.460 --> 00:08:25.930
Lord Sun, I must go now.

00:08:26.650 --> 00:08:28.310
Thank you, Lord Lee.

00:08:31.390 --> 00:08:33.450
We have found Auntie Xue.

00:08:33.450 --> 00:08:34.250
What?

00:08:35.180 --> 00:08:39.910
If you wish her to remain unharmed,
 remember your promise to me.

00:08:39.910 --> 00:08:43.680
Stop acting recklessly 
and causing trouble.

00:08:44.930 --> 00:08:45.840
I understand.

00:08:55.470 --> 00:08:56.320
Let us depart.

00:08:56.690 --> 00:09:00.320
Brother Ye and Sister-In-Law
 Princess, please stay.

00:09:03.890 --> 00:09:04.810
What is it?

00:09:05.470 --> 00:09:07.390
I... I hope you can accept this.

00:09:11.270 --> 00:09:12.680
Why are you giving me this?

00:09:13.680 --> 00:09:17.330
It's a thank you gift for giving me 
this precious Jizi orchid garland.

00:09:17.330 --> 00:09:18.790
I like it very much.

00:09:18.790 --> 00:09:23.410
And because of your amazing idea,
my birthday party could continue.

00:09:23.410 --> 00:09:26.680
Thank you for creating such 
wonderful memories for me today.

00:09:27.430 --> 00:09:30.620
Although this gift cannot 
compare with the Jizi orchids,

00:09:30.620 --> 00:09:34.810
it is still my favorite, so I hope... I hope...

00:09:37.810 --> 00:09:40.060
Thanks for the gift. I'll cherish it.

00:09:44.600 --> 00:09:46.190
Sister Princess...

00:09:55.180 --> 00:09:57.160
So she can do cute too.

00:09:58.180 --> 00:09:58.920
Let us go.

00:10:04.220 --> 00:10:06.320
My lady, let me help you.

00:10:08.220 --> 00:10:11.020
My lady, look! It is Prince and Princess Ye!

00:10:15.270 --> 00:10:16.000
Wan'er...

00:10:18.970 --> 00:10:20.430
I thank you, Princess Ye.

00:10:21.830 --> 00:10:24.180
Why are you thanking me?

00:10:27.020 --> 00:10:29.980
Oh, you're the lady whose 
purse got stolen by that thief!

00:10:30.370 --> 00:10:33.270
I do hope your cross-dressing days are over.

00:10:34.890 --> 00:10:37.660
The jade pendant in this purse is 
a memento from my deceased father.

00:10:38.150 --> 00:10:39.770
It is my most precious item.

00:10:40.270 --> 00:10:42.350
I'm very happy I could help...

00:10:46.470 --> 00:10:48.160
<i>Something's odd about this jade pendant. </i>

00:10:48.160 --> 00:10:50.110
<i>It may be possessed by a demon...</i>

00:10:54.680 --> 00:10:55.560
My lady!

00:10:57.430 --> 00:10:58.680
Did you bring your pills?

00:10:59.100 --> 00:11:03.270
I helped my mistress take 
her pills, but they have not...

00:11:04.570 --> 00:11:08.140
<i>It seems the demon's energy has 
already done great harm to her body...</i>

00:11:09.100 --> 00:11:10.760
Xin'er, do not make a fuss.

00:11:11.120 --> 00:11:12.710
I am feeling better now...

00:11:13.470 --> 00:11:16.020
If you don't mind, could I feel your pulse?

00:11:16.580 --> 00:11:17.270
What are you doing?!

00:11:17.970 --> 00:11:19.370
Just feeling her pulse!

00:11:19.370 --> 00:11:21.950
I have never heard anyone say
you could practice medicine!

00:11:23.560 --> 00:11:26.370
Just 'cause you haven't heard 
it said, it doesn't mean I can't.

00:11:26.370 --> 00:11:29.890
Miss Nan's illness has never improved. 
I have a way of treating her.

00:11:30.470 --> 00:11:32.590
P-Please do not argue.

00:11:34.930 --> 00:11:37.860
Miss Nan, could you show me your jade pendant?

00:11:40.060 --> 00:11:43.890
Of course. If it had not been for you, 
I would have lost my father's memento.

00:11:46.060 --> 00:11:51.700
<i><i>Rats, if I try exorcising the demon, it may
damage the pendant her father left her.</i></i>

00:11:51.700 --> 00:11:53.810
<i><i>Guess I need a way to 
temporarily suppress it...</i></i>

00:11:59.310 --> 00:12:02.810
Miss Nan, when you get home, 
put on a string of Bodhi seed beads.

00:12:03.560 --> 00:12:05.570
Simply wearing Bodhi seed beads will help?

00:12:07.680 --> 00:12:09.540
You must also try to relax more.

00:12:09.540 --> 00:12:12.060
Once you feel better, 
come find me in the palace.

00:12:12.320 --> 00:12:14.180
I will think of a way to cleanse you.

00:12:15.430 --> 00:12:17.920
I appreciate your help.

00:12:22.850 --> 00:12:24.310
What are you scheming?

00:12:25.220 --> 00:12:25.930
Come again?

00:12:26.930 --> 00:12:29.430
Your father corrupts, 
persecutes and harms people.

00:12:29.430 --> 00:12:32.600
Because of him, Wan'er's father died 
on the battlefield without support.

00:12:33.560 --> 00:12:37.350
Lose that innocent look and
 stop playing nice in front of me.

00:12:37.640 --> 00:12:39.950
I will make him pay for what he did.

00:12:41.100 --> 00:12:43.920
Although you are his daughter, 
I will spare your life...

00:12:44.520 --> 00:12:48.970
provided you remain in the palace 
and stay away from Wan'er.

00:12:49.610 --> 00:12:52.850
Sorry. I can't stay away from my patient.

00:12:53.610 --> 00:12:54.720
What did you say?

00:12:55.470 --> 00:12:58.100
I am not my father. I am me.

00:12:58.100 --> 00:13:02.700
Since I am sure I can cure Wan'er's 
illness, I can't just leave her like that.

00:13:02.700 --> 00:13:04.030
It's about principles.

00:13:05.230 --> 00:13:07.770
We didn't meet before we married 
and barely know each other now.

00:13:08.360 --> 00:13:12.610
Yet, you tense up whenever I do anything, and 
interpret all my good intentions negatively.

00:13:13.310 --> 00:13:14.810
Do what you want.

00:13:20.890 --> 00:13:21.680
Ye Princely Palace

00:13:21.680 --> 00:13:21.810
Ye Princely Palace

00:13:21.810 --> 00:13:22.930
Ye Princely Palace

00:13:24.600 --> 00:13:25.310
Guards!

00:13:27.270 --> 00:13:29.060
Take the princess to the Serenity Pavilion.

00:13:29.410 --> 00:13:33.070
She is not allowed to set foot outside
 the palace without my permission.

00:13:36.080 --> 00:13:39.190
<i>Seriously? You're obsessed
 with imprisoning me!</i>

00:13:46.140 --> 00:13:49.910
When I was at the princess's birthday party,
I started thinking maybe he wasn't so bad.

00:13:49.910 --> 00:13:52.560
But as soon as we get back, 
that lunatic locks me up again!

00:13:53.430 --> 00:13:54.310
I'm not happy!

00:13:55.060 --> 00:13:58.270
So Prince Ye took you to the 
princess' birthday party today?

00:13:59.060 --> 00:14:02.290
They took you away without saying anything.

00:14:02.290 --> 00:14:03.560
I was so worried about you.

00:14:04.640 --> 00:14:06.930
Look at me. I'm fine.

00:14:06.930 --> 00:14:07.900
Don't worry.

00:14:08.320 --> 00:14:09.430
Oh, right.

00:14:10.020 --> 00:14:12.060
I haven't opened the gift 
from the princess yet.

00:14:13.100 --> 00:14:14.430
Let's open it together.

00:14:16.680 --> 00:14:18.560
Wow! A whip!

00:14:19.180 --> 00:14:20.810
How exciting!

00:14:33.680 --> 00:14:36.430
I do not know how I ended up here.

00:14:38.470 --> 00:14:40.060
My lady, slow down.

00:15:06.430 --> 00:15:08.060
You look so dashing, my lady.

00:15:09.270 --> 00:15:10.940
My lady, let us take a break.

00:15:16.390 --> 00:15:18.040
That feels great.

00:15:18.040 --> 00:15:20.780
I need to thank the princess 
properly next time I see her.

00:15:26.140 --> 00:15:30.490
My lady, since the prince took you 
to the princess' birthday party,

00:15:30.490 --> 00:15:33.060
does that mean he cares about you in some way?

00:15:38.040 --> 00:15:40.680
Don't even mention that hateful, 
perverted, evil Prince Ye-diot!

00:15:42.880 --> 00:15:45.750
It doesn't matter whether he cares or not.

00:15:45.750 --> 00:15:47.800
Whenever I see him, 
I feel a burning rage inside.

00:15:47.800 --> 00:15:49.680
I wish I could steam him like a turtle!

00:15:51.670 --> 00:15:54.300
But you <i>are</i> Princess Ye, my lady.

00:15:54.680 --> 00:15:57.290
If you can get along with him
and muddle through the days,

00:15:57.290 --> 00:16:00.160
is that not the secret to a happy marriage?

00:16:00.160 --> 00:16:04.060
Que'er, have you forgotten 
what he did to us before?

00:16:07.060 --> 00:16:10.870
I avoid this kind of weirdo like the plague.

00:16:10.870 --> 00:16:12.930
How am I supposed to get along with him?

00:16:13.640 --> 00:16:16.020
We both keep our distance 
from each other now.

00:16:16.020 --> 00:16:17.060
Suits me fine.

00:16:18.250 --> 00:16:20.640
But Prince Ye is your husband.

00:16:21.720 --> 00:16:24.990
Can you truly keep your distance from him?

00:16:24.990 --> 00:16:26.180
Not a problem for me.

00:16:27.350 --> 00:16:31.400
<i>Good. I would like to find out whether 
you truly can keep your distance from me.</i>

00:16:33.450 --> 00:16:35.930
<i>Why was I eavesdropping on them?</i>
